  "title": {
   "en": "Ippai Okaeri"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "いっぱいおかえり"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "On the day that Komako is to move in with her boyfriend, he runs away from her, which is a terrible experience. Komako is deeply shocked, as she had naturally imagined that after a long relationship, they would one day live together. Suddenly, she decides to get something to eat and wanders around an unfamiliar town. She is led to an izakaya called \"Yorimichi\" by chance.\n\nThe interior of the izakaya, run by the friendly owner, has a certain warmth to it, and she is cheered by the delicious food, drinks, and words of the people inside, and she finds herself talking about her past with him...This small izakaya provides a small light for people who have reached a dead end in love, marriage, and life.\n\nThe friendly owner opens his izakaya as if waiting for everyone to return, but he has a past that he cannot tell anyone about..."
  },
